Hi Linus,

Please pull the devm_kmalloc_obj conversion for v7.4-rc1, as promised
before the merge window closes. Adds the one remaining return type
fix that didn't show up during the merge window so far (my base for
testing was 2 days ago). After that, a refresh of the existing kmalloc()
conversions, then updates to the script for devm_kmalloc(), and then those
conversions. I primarily did tons of build testing across all the archs I
could manage. I did boot testing as well, but most of these changes are in
drivers I can't test, but the conversions are, as before, very mechanical.

Thanks!

-Kees

